    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "msg_ui_btlteam_top_error_00",
      "hash64": "FC06CB2C3F628F41",
      "text": "對戰隊伍中的寶可夢有問題。\\c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "msg_ui_btlteam_top_error_01",
      "hash64": "FC06CA2C3F628D8E",
      "text": "隊伍中有寶可夢學會了\\n禁止使用的招式。\\c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "msg_ui_btlteam_top_error_02",
      "hash64": "FC06C92C3F628BDB",
      "text": "參加的寶可夢數量不足。\\c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "msg_ui_btlteam_top_error_03",
      "hash64": "FC06C82C3F628A28",
      "text": "蛋無法參加對戰。\\c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "msg_ui_btlteam_top_error_04",
      "hash64": "FC06CF2C3F62960D",
      "text": "參加的寶可夢數量太多。\\c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "msg_ui_btlteam_top_error_05",
      "hash64": "FC06CE2C3F62945A",
      "text": "必須參加的寶可夢不在隊伍之中。\\c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "msg_ui_btlteam_top_error_06",
      "hash64": "FC06CD2C3F6292A7",
      "text": "隊伍中有寶可夢學會了\\n禁止使用的招式。\\c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "msg_ui_btlteam_top_error_07",
      "hash64": "FC06CC2C3F6290F4",
      "text": "隊伍中有無法參加的寶可夢。\\c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "msg_ui_btlteam_top_error_08",
      "hash64": "FC06C32C3F6281A9",
      "text": "隊伍中有寶可夢攜帶了\\n禁止使用的道具。\\c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "msg_ui_btlteam_top_error_09",
      "hash64": "FC06C22C3F627FF6",
      "text": "寶可夢的等級未滿足\\n參加所需的條件。\\c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "msg_ui_btlteam_top_error_10",
      "hash64": "FC03452C3F5F75B8",
      "text": "隊伍中有同一種寶可夢。\\c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "msg_ui_btlteam_top_error_11",
      "hash64": "FC03462C3F5F776B",
      "text": "隊伍中有攜帶了相同道具的寶可夢。\\c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "msg_ui_btlteam_top_error_12",
      "hash64": "FC03472C3F5F791E",
      "text": "隊伍中有太多特殊的寶可夢。\\c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
